      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "FOIL: x² - 3x + 4x - 12 = x² + x - 12.",
      "steps": [
        "1. First: x × x = x².",
        "2. Outer: x × (-3) = -3x.",
        "3. Inner: 4 × x = 4x.",
        "4. Last: 4 × (-3) = -12.",
        "5. Combine: x² + x - 12."
